#. module: stock_valuation_average_price_update_by_percentage
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/stock_valuation_average_price_update_by_percentage/models/product_category.py:0
msgid ""
"For example:\n"
"Product X current cost is 30€.\n"
"Available quantity is 120 Units.\n"
"Purchased price is 35€ with 10 Units.\n"
"\n"
"Then the new cost for a product is:\n"
"((30€ * 120 + (35€ * 10)) / (120 + 10)) * (1 + %(perc)s) = %(tot)s\n"
"\n"
"The original cost would had been: %(orig_total)s"
msgstr ""
"Esimerkiksi:\n"
"Tuotteen X kustannushinta on 30€.\n"
"Saatavilla oleva varastosaldo on 120 kpl.\n"
"Ostettu hinta on 35€ ja ostettu määrä 10 kpl.\n"
"\n"
"Silloin tuotteen uusi kustannuhinta on:\n"
"((30€ * 120 + (35€ * 10)) / (120 + 10)) * (1 + %(perc)s) = %(tot)s\n"
"\n"
"Alkuperäinen kustannushinta olisi ollut: %(orig_total)s"

